WEBVTT

00:01.387 --> 00:03.757
[wind whooshing]

00:04.807 --> 00:06.637
[NARRATOR] Human beings,

00:07.557 --> 00:09.637
constantly learning,

00:09.727 --> 00:10.977
adapting,

00:11.807 --> 00:13.017
improving.

00:14.017 --> 00:18.607
If something overwhelmingly
powerful were to emerge,

00:19.107 --> 00:21.697
something with the desire
to threaten us,

00:22.657 --> 00:26.487
it will not be a monster
or a god.

00:27.117 --> 00:28.707
It will be a human.

00:28.787 --> 00:30.327
♪

00:37.257 --> 00:40.127
-[wolves growling]
-[grunting, panting]

00:43.887 --> 00:45.507
[grunts, groans]

00:45.597 --> 00:48.347
-[wolves growling]
-[grunting, panting]

00:48.727 --> 00:52.097
[grunting]

00:54.267 --> 00:55.767
Guardian's Shield!

00:55.857 --> 00:58.357
[electricity crackling]

00:58.437 --> 01:01.147
Whoo! You just got stun-locked!

01:02.197 --> 01:05.067
Ha! Believe it or not,
I'm level 73!

01:05.157 --> 01:07.077
Roll over 'cause I got
that dog in--

01:07.157 --> 01:08.237
-[wolf howling]
-[gasps]

01:08.867 --> 01:10.707
Huh?

01:11.747 --> 01:15.087
[growling]

01:15.707 --> 01:18.667
[screaming]

01:18.757 --> 01:20.877
Damn it! Okay, I'm tappin' out!

01:20.967 --> 01:22.587
-I can't finish this quest!
-[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

01:22.677 --> 01:25.637
Your current quest is,
A Secret Request.

01:25.717 --> 01:27.557
This quest cannot be abandoned.

01:27.637 --> 01:28.757
Bro, Ashur, why?

01:29.137 --> 01:32.437
What kinda busted ass NPC
hands out unbeatable quests?

01:32.517 --> 01:34.097
[grunts]

01:35.937 --> 01:36.937
[gasps]

01:43.857 --> 01:45.367
[laughing]

01:45.987 --> 01:50.577
[screaming] This game is ass!

01:55.287 --> 02:00.297
Welcome to the world's
"greatest" VR game, Satisfy.

02:00.377 --> 02:03.127
Ooh, look at that,
flying letters.

02:05.507 --> 02:09.807
I mean, it does have, like,
two billion players worldwide.

02:10.637 --> 02:13.097
It's a fantasy sandbox so huge

02:13.187 --> 02:16.437
that it's often referred to
as "another Earth."

02:19.317 --> 02:21.437
It's not just a game, though.

02:21.527 --> 02:23.737
Whatever wealth
and fame you build up in-game

02:23.817 --> 02:26.107
carries over
to your real-world bank account,

02:26.197 --> 02:27.657
affects your reputation.

02:28.817 --> 02:30.987
It's... it's big.
It's a big-ass game, you get it.

02:33.407 --> 02:35.117
[groans]

02:35.207 --> 02:37.627
Damn you, Earl Ashur!

02:37.707 --> 02:39.667
More like "Earl Asshole."

02:39.747 --> 02:41.507
Got 'im. [chuckling]

02:41.587 --> 02:42.877
[grunts]

02:42.957 --> 02:44.377
[sighs] I guess I was the one

02:44.467 --> 02:47.887
who accepted a secret
S-Rank quest at level 73.

02:47.967 --> 02:49.177
[sighs]

02:49.547 --> 02:52.387
I think these are meant for
people around level 300 or so.

02:52.967 --> 02:55.807
[taking deep breaths]
No, lock in, bro.

02:55.887 --> 02:57.937
If I push the limits
of this game

02:58.017 --> 02:59.727
and work hard,

03:00.567 --> 03:03.107
I can make a shitload o' cash!

03:03.187 --> 03:04.397
[yelling]

03:05.237 --> 03:07.697
Yes! There it is!

03:07.777 --> 03:09.987
[crying] What a long, hard road.

03:10.067 --> 03:13.037
I was so close
to dropping this stupid quest!

03:13.117 --> 03:15.867
Oh, I almost ragequit
and deleted my account!

03:15.957 --> 03:16.827
[gasps]

03:17.957 --> 03:18.917
Unidentified?

03:19.287 --> 03:21.337
Isn't the "Eye of Pallalian"...

03:25.007 --> 03:26.337
500 gold.

03:26.417 --> 03:27.677
Oh, wow.

03:27.757 --> 03:30.097
Okay, 100 gold is 12,000 yen,

03:30.177 --> 03:32.757
so, one, two,
three, four, five, six--

03:32.847 --> 03:35.427
Sixty thousand yen?!

03:35.517 --> 03:37.557
To ID a single frickin' item?!

03:37.637 --> 03:40.437
Those predatory devs
and their insatiable greed!

03:40.517 --> 03:42.647
Do they really expect me
to throw my money at them

03:42.727 --> 03:44.227
and go into debt again?!

03:44.317 --> 03:47.027
[groaning]

03:47.107 --> 03:48.107
[chuckles]

03:48.607 --> 03:51.067
Good luck with those minimum
payments next month, me!

03:51.157 --> 03:53.577
-Huh?
-[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

03:53.657 --> 03:56.447
Identifying "The Legendary
Craftsman's Tome."

03:59.617 --> 04:01.167
ID complete.

04:01.957 --> 04:04.667
You have discovered
a legendary item.

04:05.337 --> 04:07.667
This book contains
the techniques of Pagma,

04:07.757 --> 04:09.797
a master blacksmith
who transcended the limits

04:09.887 --> 04:11.257
of mortal skill.

04:11.337 --> 04:13.297
Opening the book
will change your class

04:13.387 --> 04:15.717
to "Pagma's Successor."

04:15.807 --> 04:18.687
You'll not only become famous
on this continent

04:18.767 --> 04:20.897
but a legend
throughout this world.

04:21.937 --> 04:23.437
[gasps]

04:26.067 --> 04:27.737
Pagma's Successor.

04:29.397 --> 04:32.407
Hell yeah! Let's freakin' go!

04:33.027 --> 04:34.157
Legendary class-change book?

04:34.657 --> 04:38.197
That means the only person
who gets to be this class is me!

04:38.787 --> 04:40.117
[takes deep breath]

04:40.207 --> 04:41.667
Calm down, Grid.

04:41.747 --> 04:42.997
If you bring this book
to the quest - giver,

04:43.077 --> 04:44.747
not only
will you clear the quest,

04:44.837 --> 04:46.087
you'll get the reward.

04:46.167 --> 04:47.587
But...

04:47.667 --> 04:50.047
I'll make way more
if I sell it on the market!

04:50.127 --> 04:52.587
I bet it's worth
tens of millions of yen!

04:52.677 --> 04:55.387
You're worth all I've spent
on this game, yes, you are!

04:55.467 --> 04:57.347
Time to log out!

05:01.387 --> 05:03.357
-What happened?
-[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

05:03.437 --> 05:06.017
Your choice has altered
the content of the quest.

05:06.107 --> 05:07.857
It remains a special quest,

05:07.937 --> 05:09.687
therefore it cannot
be abandoned.

05:09.777 --> 05:10.777
The game will proceed

05:10.857 --> 05:12.487
-based on your choice.
-Huh?

05:12.567 --> 05:13.947
[GAME VOICE]
The quest has changed to...

05:14.027 --> 05:16.867
"Earl Ashur's Wrath, SS rank."

05:17.327 --> 05:19.827
The ruler of Patrian
is infuriated

05:19.907 --> 05:21.827
by your decision
to steal the book,

05:21.907 --> 05:24.957
and as such, will attempt
to kill you to retrieve it.

05:25.037 --> 05:27.247
Your greed will be your undoing.

05:27.337 --> 05:29.167
You have forsaken
our contract...

05:29.257 --> 05:30.377
What? Are you kidding me?

05:30.757 --> 05:32.877
[ASHUR]...and chosen
the dark path of the traitor.

05:32.967 --> 05:34.887
I shall give you
what you've earned.

05:34.967 --> 05:37.217
You're telling me I busted
my ass and went into debt for--

05:37.307 --> 05:38.757
-Your death.
-[gasps]

05:38.847 --> 05:39.887
[game voice
talking indistinctly]

05:39.967 --> 05:41.267
Seize him!

05:41.557 --> 05:43.687
[GAME VOICE]...from accessing
Patrian territory.

05:43.767 --> 05:45.977
In addition, the failure
of a quest ranked...

05:46.057 --> 05:47.017
Aw, god!

05:47.567 --> 05:49.647
I slaved for months,
and this is how they repay me?

05:49.727 --> 05:52.447
It's just not fair! [gasps]

05:53.447 --> 05:55.527
[gasps] Retrieve the book!

05:58.077 --> 05:59.657
[soldiers grunt]

05:59.737 --> 06:00.697
[scoffs]

06:00.787 --> 06:02.287
Aw, that's too bad!

06:02.367 --> 06:04.077
And too late, you dickhead!

06:05.707 --> 06:07.377
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

06:07.457 --> 06:08.417
All skills and stats

06:08.707 --> 06:10.547
from your current class
will be reset.

06:10.627 --> 06:11.797
[struggling]

06:11.877 --> 06:13.217
[GAME VOICE]
Your class will change

06:13.297 --> 06:16.087
to "Legendary Blacksmith,
Pagma's Successor."

06:16.587 --> 06:18.507
[Ashur grunting]

06:18.597 --> 06:20.097
[♪ dramatic music playing]

06:22.517 --> 06:25.387
[GAME VOICE] You will learn
Master Blacksmith skills.

06:25.977 --> 06:28.857
All skills have been
acquired and mastered.

06:28.937 --> 06:31.937
You now have access
to the highest-level techniques,

06:32.027 --> 06:34.447
the Legendary Blacksmith
techniques.

06:35.027 --> 06:38.067
"Indomitability" stat unlocked.

06:43.997 --> 06:45.577
Class change complete.

06:46.207 --> 06:48.997
[PLAYER] I can feel
the power welling up inside me!

06:49.627 --> 06:51.667
Man, look at that idiot
losing his shit!

06:51.757 --> 06:53.167
Awesome.

06:56.007 --> 06:58.837
Get ready,
you plague-doctor wannabes.

06:58.927 --> 07:00.507
'Cause I'm about to take belt--

07:00.597 --> 07:02.717
-[GAME VOICE] You are level one.
-Aa!

07:02.807 --> 07:03.967
[shatters]

07:13.817 --> 07:15.857
[GAME VOICE]
The failure of an SS-Rank quest

07:15.947 --> 07:18.987
has caused your level
to drop by two.

07:19.777 --> 07:23.657
Your current player level is -1.

07:31.957 --> 07:33.457
[MAN 1] The sun's barely up.

07:33.547 --> 07:35.957
You sure this couldn't wait
until we've all had our coffee?

07:36.047 --> 07:37.297
[MAN 2] 'Fraid not.

07:37.377 --> 07:39.547
I'd say the birth
of a legendary class change

07:39.637 --> 07:40.927
is worth the wake-up call.

07:42.257 --> 07:43.847
Fair point.
This is just as big a deal

07:43.927 --> 07:45.887
as that player who went
to the Eastern Continent.

07:47.017 --> 07:49.267
Ah, you mean "The Challenger
of the Behen Archipelago"?

07:49.347 --> 07:50.857
That's Ashur-class or higher.

07:50.937 --> 07:52.067
Nothing to scoff at.

07:53.187 --> 07:54.227
He made his way to the East,

07:54.527 --> 07:56.647
but the island chain itself
remains uncleared.

07:56.737 --> 07:58.527
This new one
ought to be exciting.

07:58.607 --> 07:59.817
I have the data here.

08:00.617 --> 08:02.447
Okay, let's hear
this emergency report.

08:03.577 --> 08:05.037
Yes, sir.

08:05.117 --> 08:07.747
This is the player who had
the legendary class change.

08:07.827 --> 08:09.827
His user ID is "Grid."

08:09.917 --> 08:12.247
His real name is
Takumi Nagamine,

08:12.327 --> 08:14.377
a 25-year-old from Japan.

08:15.457 --> 08:17.917
He was originally
a level 73 warrior,

08:18.007 --> 08:20.257
but now, he's down to -1.

08:20.837 --> 08:24.007
As you can see,
his abilities are below average.

08:24.097 --> 08:26.007
There's nothing noteworthy
about him.

08:26.767 --> 08:30.307
While this may be disappointing
for the ops team to hear,

08:30.387 --> 08:32.937
his class change was
likely just a coincidence.

08:35.147 --> 08:36.277
Really, now?

08:36.777 --> 08:38.527
You think this was
just a coincidence?

08:39.147 --> 08:40.237
[gasps]

08:40.647 --> 08:42.567
[SAKAEDA] And yet
none of Satisfy's most popular,

08:42.657 --> 08:44.737
high-ranked players
have been able to pull this off.

08:45.827 --> 08:46.867
Take a look at the screen.

08:47.497 --> 08:48.537
There's Kraugel,

08:48.957 --> 08:51.417
the user with the highest rank
in the entire game.

08:51.497 --> 08:54.667
Jishuka, the guildmaster
of the Tsedakah guild,

08:54.747 --> 08:56.757
which is home
to several top-ranked players,

08:56.837 --> 08:58.917
not to mention
the number-one bow user.

08:59.467 --> 09:02.257
They're both very talented,
but normal class.

09:02.637 --> 09:03.597
Now, obviously,

09:04.097 --> 09:06.427
those who belong to
classes above normal do exist,

09:06.507 --> 09:07.927
but somehow...

09:08.557 --> 09:10.767
this "Grid" player
became Pagma's Successor

09:10.847 --> 09:11.887
out of the blue.

09:11.977 --> 09:12.977
Legendary,

09:13.437 --> 09:15.517
as if he found a way
to sneak past the best players

09:15.607 --> 09:17.317
and steal the crown for himself.

09:18.067 --> 09:20.607
[HINAKO] Regardless,
our supercomputer, Morpheus,

09:20.687 --> 09:22.817
predicted that Pagma's Tome
wouldn't be discovered

09:22.907 --> 09:25.527
for at least another two years
in game-time.

09:25.617 --> 09:28.037
We checked for bugs
but didn't find any.

09:28.117 --> 09:30.037
The system is operating
as it should.

09:30.117 --> 09:31.867
You know what that means?

09:31.957 --> 09:34.207
This "Grid"
gained a powerful class

09:34.287 --> 09:37.797
and also an advantage in a way
that we didn't anticipate.

09:37.877 --> 09:39.297
A negative level.

09:39.877 --> 09:43.757
Grid happened to fail the quest
just after changing classes,

09:43.837 --> 09:45.967
and then,
thanks to the failure penalty,

09:46.047 --> 09:48.057
he's now a level -1.

09:48.717 --> 09:49.677
Now, you see,

09:50.177 --> 09:52.517
this would never happen
under normal circumstances,

09:52.597 --> 09:54.897
because a quest of that rank
could never be accepted

09:54.977 --> 09:56.857
by characters under level 10.

09:57.727 --> 10:00.317
That's true. As of now,
he's the only player

10:00.397 --> 10:02.357
with a character level of -1.

10:02.437 --> 10:04.197
But what does that mean for us?

10:04.277 --> 10:05.947
Don't you see it?

10:06.027 --> 10:08.277
If he levels twice back to one,

10:08.367 --> 10:10.577
he'll gain stat points
he shouldn't have.

10:10.657 --> 10:13.827
So, this accidental master will
end up with higher stat points

10:13.907 --> 10:15.417
than other users
of the same level.

10:15.497 --> 10:16.577
[all gasp]

10:17.497 --> 10:18.997
Now, then,

10:19.087 --> 10:22.167
can we still assume that
this is all just a coincidence?

10:27.677 --> 10:29.347
[digital beeping, whirring]

10:29.427 --> 10:31.927
[sighs] Yeah.

10:32.017 --> 10:34.767
"The world's greatest game,"
my fine, shapely ass.

10:34.847 --> 10:38.017
Cool that months of hard work
got sucked into the abyss,

10:38.107 --> 10:39.437
and I still
have to pay the lease

10:39.517 --> 10:41.607
on the most expensive
gaming chair in the world.

10:43.027 --> 10:44.437
-[gasps]
-Hey, Takumi?

10:44.527 --> 10:45.527
Are you awake yet?

10:47.617 --> 10:50.327
Were you seriously
up all night gaming again?

10:50.407 --> 10:52.247
-[bottles clattering]
-[gasps]

10:52.327 --> 10:54.617
Don't scare me like that.
I coulda dropkicked you!

10:54.707 --> 10:56.997
Really? You can't even
clean up your trash.

10:57.827 --> 10:58.877
[sniffs]

10:59.167 --> 11:01.417
And, uh, when's
the last time you showered?

11:01.497 --> 11:04.467
Seira, that's the smell
of hard work.

11:04.547 --> 11:05.507
[grunts]

11:05.797 --> 11:06.797
Come on.

11:07.337 --> 11:09.007
You know you've got Mom and Dad
worried sick, don't you?

11:09.927 --> 11:11.847
Takumi, that's it!

11:12.507 --> 11:14.517
You need to stop
playing games all night!

11:14.597 --> 11:17.517
If you have so much free time,
then come help out at the shop!

11:17.597 --> 11:18.897
Okay. First of all,

11:18.977 --> 11:20.607
the shop isn't even busy enough
to need my help.

11:20.687 --> 11:22.687
-Don't talk back to me!
-Well,

11:22.767 --> 11:24.567
it's nice that he's working hard
at something, right?

11:24.647 --> 11:26.187
Do not baby him!

11:26.277 --> 11:27.397
[both whimpering]

11:27.487 --> 11:30.327
Mom, I think they get the idea.

11:30.827 --> 11:32.327
[sighs] Fine.

11:32.907 --> 11:34.247
Breakfast is on the table.

11:34.327 --> 11:36.247
Your father and I
are off to open up.

11:36.827 --> 11:38.247
Sleep or no sleep,

11:38.327 --> 11:40.667
you'd better not be late
for work!

11:41.957 --> 11:43.917
[TV HOST 1]
Today on Satisfy Every.

11:44.007 --> 11:45.167
[TV HOST 2] Good morning!

11:45.257 --> 11:46.467
[SEIRA] Not gonna lie.

11:46.547 --> 11:47.877
This is crazy.

11:47.967 --> 11:49.547
The game is so popular.

11:49.637 --> 11:51.597
Look how many channels
are dedicated to it.

11:52.257 --> 11:54.557
See? I'm not wasting my life.
Imma make money.

11:55.097 --> 11:56.347
Whoa.

11:56.427 --> 11:58.267
-She's gorgeous.
-Hmm?

11:58.347 --> 12:00.267
[TV HOST 2]
And the number one black mage.

12:00.357 --> 12:02.517
[TAKUMI]
That's Yura, the Blood Witch.

12:02.607 --> 12:04.267
[SEIRA] Wait, what? No way!

12:04.357 --> 12:05.687
-You mean the model?
-Yup.

12:06.317 --> 12:09.527
She's one of the most famous
Satisfy players in the world.

12:09.607 --> 12:12.867
Her exploits in the game are
what made her a celebrity IRL.

12:13.407 --> 12:14.527
[SEIRA] Oh, wow. So she's like

12:14.617 --> 12:16.247
the complete opposite
of you, then.

12:16.327 --> 12:17.827
[TAKUMI] What? Don't say that!

12:20.117 --> 12:21.327
[STAFF 1] Nagamine.

12:21.787 --> 12:23.837
Takumi Nagamine.

12:23.917 --> 12:25.247
[TAKUMI] Oh. Yeah?

12:25.337 --> 12:26.757
Do you wanna get paid or what?

12:27.417 --> 12:28.837
Go home. We're locking up.

12:29.587 --> 12:30.717
[groans]

12:31.087 --> 12:33.967
Physical labor after gaming
all night is brutal, man.

12:34.047 --> 12:36.007
That guy's
so addicted to his games,

12:36.097 --> 12:37.677
I don't think
that he ever sleeps.

12:37.767 --> 12:40.307
That explains
why he's so useless, then.

12:40.387 --> 12:41.597
[STAFF 4]
Guys like that'll screw up

12:41.687 --> 12:43.147
anything you ask 'em to do.

12:46.437 --> 12:47.937
[inhales] Sweet.

12:48.027 --> 12:49.987
This'll be just enough
to cover my student loans

12:50.067 --> 12:51.987
and this month's
game subscription fee.

12:52.067 --> 12:54.527
Now, as for this new debt.

12:55.197 --> 12:56.077
God.

12:56.157 --> 12:57.867
What the hell am I even doing?

12:57.947 --> 12:58.997
You know?

13:01.077 --> 13:05.287
It's like, no matter what I do,
things never seem to work out.

13:05.747 --> 13:07.337
Back in school, I was bullied.

13:07.837 --> 13:09.757
I was invisible
to my first crush.

13:11.467 --> 13:12.427
So, I thought

13:13.137 --> 13:15.637
if I grinded hard enough to get
good at the game and got rich,

13:15.717 --> 13:17.307
I could prove 'em wrong.

13:17.387 --> 13:18.517
At least a little.

13:20.227 --> 13:24.767
But now, all I've managed to do
is worry my family.

13:25.767 --> 13:28.317
I don't even know
what I'm still trying for.

13:28.397 --> 13:30.607
Maybe I should just
quit the game and move on.

13:32.317 --> 13:33.487
[inhales deeply]

13:35.907 --> 13:37.867
Well, it's not every day

13:37.947 --> 13:40.117
that you get a legendary class,
I guess.

13:40.827 --> 13:42.707
[chuckles] Maybe I should stay.

13:42.787 --> 13:44.377
Give the game one last shot.

13:50.007 --> 13:51.377
[GAME VOICE 1] Satisfy!

13:51.467 --> 13:53.467
- Ready?
-Hell yeah.

13:55.467 --> 13:57.097
[GAME VOICE 1] Stand by.

13:57.637 --> 14:00.307
Three, two, one.

14:00.387 --> 14:02.387
Ready. Enter!

14:03.517 --> 14:05.607
[GAME VOICE 2]
Accessing Satisfy.

14:12.237 --> 14:14.027
Uh, Where am I?

14:14.107 --> 14:15.567
-[GAME VOICE 2] System guidance.
-What?

14:15.657 --> 14:17.407
Your failure
to complete the quest

14:17.487 --> 14:20.747
means you can no longer
access Patrian territory.

14:20.827 --> 14:21.827
[grumbles]

14:23.747 --> 14:26.877
[TAKUMI] Ugh. I'm seriously -1?

14:27.337 --> 14:29.837
And of course,
my stats are absolute trash.

14:30.957 --> 14:32.047
Huh.

14:32.127 --> 14:34.217
But these class effects
are promising.

14:34.967 --> 14:37.217
So then,
if I can equip any of my gear...

14:39.717 --> 14:40.807
Whoa.

14:40.887 --> 14:42.887
Glad I didn't sell
these old items yet.

14:42.977 --> 14:45.057
[GAME VOICE 2] Because you
do not meet the requirements

14:45.137 --> 14:46.687
-for these level 60 items...
-Damn.

14:46.767 --> 14:48.727
...a penalty will be applied.

14:48.807 --> 14:50.067
[TAKUMI] That's still plenty!

14:50.147 --> 14:51.977
All right, legendary class!

14:53.187 --> 14:54.317
Okay.

14:54.397 --> 14:56.357
So there's gotta be
a village nearby.

14:56.447 --> 14:57.527
[gasps]

14:57.617 --> 14:58.697
[grumbles]

14:58.777 --> 15:01.277
Damn it! Yatan Temple, really?

15:01.367 --> 15:03.447
That's a level 150 dungeon!

15:03.537 --> 15:04.787
Screw you, devs.

15:05.367 --> 15:07.667
-[woman struggling]
-[cultists] Fill the vessel.

15:07.747 --> 15:10.667
Fill the vessel.

15:10.747 --> 15:13.167
Fill the vessel.

15:13.257 --> 15:15.837
Fill the vessel.

15:15.917 --> 15:19.297
[CULTIST] Slumbering spirits
in the pits of hell!

15:19.927 --> 15:22.387
[TAKUMI] Those have to be
Yatan Cultists, right?

15:22.847 --> 15:25.727
Doing a-- Oh my god,
a cursed ritual?

15:25.807 --> 15:27.847
Ugh. If these creeps find me,
they'll kill me.

15:27.937 --> 15:29.357
I need to find a teleporter

15:29.437 --> 15:31.107
and bounce
before they get the chance.

15:31.937 --> 15:34.777
[grunting]

15:35.527 --> 15:37.817
[cultists chanting]
Fill the vessel.

15:37.897 --> 15:39.367
-[MAN] Calm yourself.
-Huh?

15:40.987 --> 15:42.827
I am Doran,
an undercover guardian

15:42.907 --> 15:44.367
of the great
House of Earl Steim.

15:44.867 --> 15:46.157
[TAKUMI] Okay.

15:46.247 --> 15:48.327
[cultists chanting]
Fill the vessel.

15:48.917 --> 15:51.037
-[TAKUMI] Irene?
-[DORAN] Yes.

15:51.667 --> 15:53.247
Earl Steim's daughter.

15:53.337 --> 15:56.417
She was kidnapped while visiting
a provincial town nearby.

15:57.047 --> 15:59.137
Irene is intelligent,
compassionate,

15:59.217 --> 16:00.677
and deeply beloved
by her people,

16:00.757 --> 16:03.137
who eagerly await
her ascent to the throne.

16:03.217 --> 16:06.137
I am grateful to have assistance
rescuing our future ruler.

16:06.227 --> 16:08.387
Oh, no, you don't mean...

16:08.477 --> 16:09.557
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

16:09.637 --> 16:11.647
An S-Rank quest has been issued.

16:11.727 --> 16:12.897
[TAKUMI] -2?

16:12.977 --> 16:14.567
Well, I'm already down to -1,

16:14.647 --> 16:16.027
so what's another kick
in the jewels?

16:16.107 --> 16:18.317
Most men would be
petrified with fear

16:18.397 --> 16:20.197
in a perilous situation
like this,

16:20.277 --> 16:22.237
but you, my friend,
have great fortitude.

16:24.197 --> 16:25.497
[Takumi sighs]

16:26.117 --> 16:28.207
Thank you, good sir,
for deciding to aid me.

16:28.287 --> 16:29.157
I did not.

16:30.997 --> 16:32.377
-But you will--
-I will not.

16:32.457 --> 16:33.957
Please, I cannot do battle

16:34.037 --> 16:35.707
-with all those men alone!
-That sounds like a you problem!

16:35.797 --> 16:37.417
I beg of you, please, sir!

16:37.507 --> 16:39.217
My lady's life is in danger!

16:39.297 --> 16:41.637
I would love to,
but I wouldn't be much help!

16:41.717 --> 16:44.137
I'm too low level
and not remotely strong enough!

16:44.217 --> 16:45.887
-Would you let go?!
-[rock thuds]

16:45.967 --> 16:47.267
-[both grunting]
-[body thuds]

16:47.347 --> 16:49.427
[footsteps running]

16:49.517 --> 16:50.557
[BOTH] Huh?

16:52.397 --> 16:54.727
[Takumi gasps]

16:54.807 --> 16:58.397
Fools! You dare stand against
the omnipotent god, Yatan?

16:58.487 --> 16:59.737
Kill them!

16:59.817 --> 17:01.147
[GAME VOICE]
You have accepted the quest,

17:01.237 --> 17:03.117
-"Rescue the Earl's Daughter."
-[yelling] No!

17:03.197 --> 17:05.657
Now that you've alerted them,
they'll never let you escape.

17:05.737 --> 17:07.617
It seems the two of us
must join forces!

17:07.697 --> 17:09.077
Oh, this is such horseshit!
I hate you! [yells]

17:09.157 --> 17:10.407
[DORAN] Let us go!

17:11.327 --> 17:13.787
[screaming]

17:13.877 --> 17:14.877
[groans]

17:15.497 --> 17:17.167
-So, do we have a plan?
-Of course we do!

17:17.247 --> 17:18.797
-We shall clear a path!
-Huh?

17:19.337 --> 17:20.507
-[grunts]
-[slashes]

17:21.337 --> 17:22.387
[groans]

17:22.467 --> 17:25.637
[groaning, grunting]

17:25.717 --> 17:27.517
[TAKUMI] Holy crap!

17:27.597 --> 17:29.847
What an OP-MF-NPC!

17:29.927 --> 17:33.017
So OP that he might be able
to clear the quest for me.

17:34.647 --> 17:36.567
Well, what can I do to help?

17:37.107 --> 17:38.477
Hmm. Play support!

17:39.317 --> 17:41.027
You got this, Doran!

17:41.107 --> 17:44.367
You're my hero, my hope,
my shining light, et cetera!

17:44.777 --> 17:45.777
[DORAN] Thank you, my friend!

17:46.407 --> 17:48.237
You realize
that fighting them one by one

17:48.327 --> 17:49.447
would be a fatal mistake,

17:49.537 --> 17:51.247
so you distracted me
to give me pause.

17:51.327 --> 17:52.657
That's, uh, not what I...

17:53.287 --> 17:55.167
Cultists, meet your end!

17:55.627 --> 17:57.087
Protect them, Diamond Shield.

17:59.957 --> 18:00.837
[scoffs]

18:01.757 --> 18:02.797
Interesting.

18:02.877 --> 18:04.637
I'm surprised to see you here.

18:05.047 --> 18:07.847
You're the one who started
this quest for me, aren't you?

18:08.597 --> 18:10.177
I want to thank you,

18:10.267 --> 18:12.177
but unfortunately,
I must defeat you

18:12.267 --> 18:13.517
to finish my quest.

18:14.137 --> 18:15.647
I'll make this quick.

18:15.727 --> 18:18.107
I, Yura, the Blood Witch,
challenge you.

18:19.567 --> 18:22.067
I'm currently level 230.

18:22.607 --> 18:24.527
Are you prepared to face me?

18:24.607 --> 18:26.567
-Doran, wait!
-There's no time for fear.

18:26.657 --> 18:29.077
He who charges
toward opportunity

18:29.157 --> 18:30.657
will reap its rewards!

18:34.207 --> 18:35.537
You're fast, old man.

18:35.617 --> 18:37.127
Let's slow you down.

18:38.997 --> 18:41.247
[straining]

18:41.337 --> 18:43.757
Your dark tricks
will work on me, witch!

18:43.837 --> 18:45.177
Oh.

18:45.257 --> 18:47.087
-Well, then...
-[grunts]

18:48.217 --> 18:49.847
[groaning]

18:50.557 --> 18:52.557
If that didn't work, this will.

18:52.637 --> 18:53.977
It's over.

18:54.677 --> 18:57.057
[screaming]

18:57.147 --> 18:58.057
No!

18:59.147 --> 19:01.027
Doran is totally stacked,

19:01.107 --> 19:02.857
and he couldn't
make a dent in her.

19:03.227 --> 19:05.567
Is the Blood Witch
really that powerful?

19:06.197 --> 19:08.947
[DORAN] Foolhardy,
arrogant, young black mage.

19:09.447 --> 19:11.327
Behold the power
that has defended

19:11.407 --> 19:13.497
the earl's family
for hundreds of years!

19:16.077 --> 19:16.957
Uh...

19:17.957 --> 19:19.417
What the hell just happened?

19:19.497 --> 19:22.087
[DORAN] Such is the majesty
of this ring.

19:22.167 --> 19:24.337
It has the power
to heal and block curses.

19:24.417 --> 19:26.297
-Gimme that shit.
-Wha?

19:26.377 --> 19:28.797
No, why would you even
ask such a thing? Gods.

19:29.427 --> 19:30.347
[huffs]

19:31.387 --> 19:33.717
It seems they will give us
no quarter.

19:34.807 --> 19:36.017
Nameless adventurer.

19:36.557 --> 19:38.937
I will fend off the enemy,

19:39.017 --> 19:41.017
while you must rescue milady.

19:41.107 --> 19:43.187
Future Ruler Irene
of House Steim.

19:43.277 --> 19:44.567
Bro, what are you doing?

19:44.647 --> 19:45.897
You can't fight
all these dudes by yourself.

19:45.987 --> 19:47.107
[DORAN] But I must.

19:47.197 --> 19:49.447
One day, you'll understand.

19:50.487 --> 19:52.407
-Onward!
-Uh, wait! [grunts]

19:52.487 --> 19:53.697
God damn it!

19:54.447 --> 19:55.697
[panting]

19:55.787 --> 19:57.407
[♪ tense music playing]

19:59.827 --> 20:01.287
[straining]

20:02.877 --> 20:04.747
Arise, Children of Yatan.

20:04.837 --> 20:06.257
Death to the heretic!

20:06.337 --> 20:08.547
How in the hell
do they respawn this fast?

20:08.627 --> 20:10.467
Doran, I can't do this, buddy!

20:10.547 --> 20:12.297
[gasps] Oh, gods!

20:12.387 --> 20:14.927
[YURA] You should
stay focused during a battle.

20:15.017 --> 20:16.517
This time, you die.

20:17.347 --> 20:18.727
Dark Storm!

20:21.057 --> 20:22.647
[DORAN] By the heavens.

20:22.727 --> 20:23.687
I'm doomed!

20:23.767 --> 20:25.777
[energy roaring]

20:40.787 --> 20:41.667
Hmm.

20:43.417 --> 20:44.547
[gasps]

20:47.167 --> 20:50.297
[both gasping]

20:50.377 --> 20:51.467
What?

20:51.547 --> 20:53.757
How the hell
is this guy not dead?

20:55.387 --> 20:57.347
I still have one HP left?

20:57.887 --> 20:59.477
Wait, is that... [gasps]

20:59.557 --> 21:01.897
My class's immortality bonus!

21:02.517 --> 21:04.977
Huh! Let's freakin' go!

21:05.567 --> 21:06.857
-[YURA] You!
-Uh.

21:06.937 --> 21:08.647
Tell me who you are.

21:08.737 --> 21:11.357
-[chuckles] Oh, Imma tell you.
-[yells]

21:11.447 --> 21:13.237
-[grunts]
-[yelps]

21:13.947 --> 21:14.947
I told you!

21:15.277 --> 21:18.077
Those who seize opportunity
reap the rewards!

21:18.157 --> 21:19.947
-[YURA] Guardian's Shield!
-[Doran grunts]

21:20.037 --> 21:22.417
She still has such power?

21:23.747 --> 21:24.667
[smirks]

21:25.247 --> 21:26.247
[gasps]

21:27.957 --> 21:29.167
He logged out?

21:30.167 --> 21:31.217
[growls]

21:31.297 --> 21:32.337
[rumbling]

21:37.427 --> 21:38.597
[GAME VOICE]
S-Rank quest failure

21:38.677 --> 21:40.847
has caused your level
to drop by 2.

21:41.847 --> 21:44.437
-Your current level is -3.
-[fuming]

21:44.517 --> 21:47.317
Because you have died twice
in 24 hours,

21:47.397 --> 21:49.977
you cannot log in for 12 hours.

21:50.067 --> 21:52.947
That asshole Doran killed me
with friendly freakin' fire!

21:53.027 --> 21:54.067
Wait, no, no, no!

21:54.367 --> 21:56.407
This is all that seal clubber
Yura's fault!

21:56.487 --> 21:59.367
I'll show you who's a loser!

21:59.447 --> 22:00.907
-[screams]
-[TAKUMI'S MOM] Takumi!

22:00.997 --> 22:03.577
-Do you know what time it is?
-[SEIRA] Shut up! Oh my god!

22:03.667 --> 22:05.287
[TAKUMI'S DAD] Please,
just one normal night of sleep.

22:06.667 --> 22:08.337
[TV HOST] This is Satisfy News.

22:08.417 --> 22:10.877
Let's check in with our
in-game journalist, Sumita,

22:10.957 --> 22:12.257
for a breaking news report.

22:12.337 --> 22:13.717
Well, as you can see,

22:13.797 --> 22:15.717
last night, here at Yatan Temple

22:15.797 --> 22:16.637
in the north
of Eternal Kingdom...

22:16.717 --> 22:17.717
[Takumi spits]

22:18.217 --> 22:19.967
...there was a catastrophic
structural collapse!

22:20.057 --> 22:21.097
Believe it or not,

22:21.517 --> 22:23.097
all the devastation
you see on your screen...

22:23.177 --> 22:24.887
[TAKUMI] Is this from...

22:24.977 --> 22:25.937
[TV HOST]...unidentified player
blocked an attack

22:26.017 --> 22:27.767
from the famous
Blood Witch, Yura!

22:27.857 --> 22:29.527
-Wait? I'm famous now?
-The whereabouts of this

22:29.607 --> 22:31.027
mysterious player
are still unknown,

22:31.107 --> 22:34.027
so we're asking viewers to share
any information they have.

22:34.107 --> 22:35.527
Let's hear what
our sole witness has to...

22:35.607 --> 22:36.867
[RECEPTIONIST]
Satisfy News reception desk.

22:36.947 --> 22:37.947
How can I help you?

22:38.027 --> 22:39.537
Hi, yes! Hello!
I just saw the news,

22:39.617 --> 22:40.657
and I just wanted to confirm

22:40.987 --> 22:43.287
that I am the mysterious
Yatan Temple wrecker!

22:43.367 --> 22:45.327
[RECEPTIONIST] Okay, can you
give me your user ID, please?

22:45.417 --> 22:46.497
Yeah, it's "Grid."

22:46.577 --> 22:47.627
[RECEPTIONIST]
And what is your level?

22:47.707 --> 22:49.627
-Yeah, it's -3!
-[phone disconnects]

22:49.707 --> 22:53.377
Yura, more like "Yura bitch."

22:53.457 --> 22:55.507
[SUMITA]
Well, that's unsatisfying.

22:55.587 --> 22:57.637
That's all from the scene.

22:57.717 --> 22:58.637
[TV switches off]

22:59.717 --> 23:02.387
I'm pretty sure Doran didn't
make it outta there alive.

23:02.467 --> 23:04.887
Aw, damn. RIP, OP NPC.

23:06.057 --> 23:08.107
And RIP that badass ring.

23:08.727 --> 23:11.107
If I had an awesome item
like that, maybe...

23:11.977 --> 23:13.317
What am I saying?

23:13.397 --> 23:15.447
I can't get my hands
on something like that.

23:16.737 --> 23:18.317
Wait, hang on.

23:19.237 --> 23:20.327
That's right.

23:20.407 --> 23:22.907
I'm the Legendary
Blacksmith now.

23:25.657 --> 23:27.827
If I want one, I can make it.

23:28.537 --> 23:30.457
I will gear myself up
and get strong,

23:30.537 --> 23:31.797
go make some real cash.

23:32.667 --> 23:33.837
And then,

23:33.917 --> 23:36.217
I can finally kiss
this loser life goodbye.
